IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `maib-core`
IMPORT `maib-seat`
IMPORT `maib-seat-board`

-- Cases for the Board's seat (maib-seat-board.l4), with MIRROR CASES (the same facts asked from the individual's seat
-- in maib-seat.l4, with answers that agree) and the REGULATIVE RULES of maib-core.l4 traced. Every case is
-- HYPOTHETICAL.
--
-- Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited Act and Regulations. Regulative rules: clock in days,
-- day 0 the date of the accident (10 March 2026). A trace that ends FULFILLED is asserted with EVALTRACE; one that
-- ends in a breach or a pending obligation is #TRACEd with an "-- expect:" line, and was read.

`the accident date` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 10 3 2026

§ `Cases -- the Board's seat, mirror cases, and the regulative rules`

§§ `Must I pay? (ss 23-24) -- mirrored`

