`B1` MEANS `Must I pay scheduled benefits for this injury` `in this State` `in this State` `none of those` `none of those` `a collision, or action taken to avoid a collision, with it` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `any other motor vehicle` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `none of the offences in s 24 (2) (a)` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
`B1 from the injured person's seat` MEANS `Is MAIB liable to pay me scheduled benefits for this accident` `in this State` `in this State` `none of those` `none of those` `a collision, or action taken to avoid a collision, with it` 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `any other motor vehicle` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `none of the offences in s 24 (2) (a)` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
